Z||000000||burdell1||09-17-1999||08:17 AM||||I've read about switching the headlight motor system between the early models (mines an '85) and the later models. What do you have to change? How much of the wiring for the old style do you leave in?<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||DJRice||09-17-1999||09:02 AM||||If you can find a donor car, the easiet thing to do would be to remove the entire light harness and replace it with the newer version.  The big connector that attaches to the firewall is a two piece.  As I recall, one is the lights, and the other is everything else up front.||||reg||1
