Z||000004||theogre||09-21-1999||12:26 PM||||You Can't switch just the motors. You have to take the controler and most, if not all, of the wiring. the wire from the firewall up is definatly diferant. wether or not its plug compatible between years I don't know. The wiring from the dash switch to the firewall looks the same in what little schematics I have.||||reg||1
